SUMMARY:Open Signal: The Sci Fi Book Club
DESCRIPTION:The Sci Fi Book Club\nYou asked\, we listened! We're back for 
 another **monthly casual Zoom hangout** to chat about what you're watching
 \, listening to\, reading\, and doing for fun. We're calling it *Open Sign
 al*\, so bring your thoughts\, interesting articles\, and any other sci fi
 -related news or discoveries you'd like to share. Our next installment wil
 l be Thursday\, July 9th at 7pm ET.\n\nOne of the best things about this c
 ommunity is the wide range of interests and experiences you all bring to o
 ur meetings. We can't wait to catch up with y'all and get some fresh media
  recommendations. As a reminder\, no political discussion and everyone is 
 welcome.\n\nThis is not a Book of the Month meeting\, more a chance to get
  together and chat about everything else. ***Book of the Month meetings wi
 ll continue to be held on Zoom on the third Sunday of each month.***\n\nCh
 eers\,\nJon & Meghan
